msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff:1 of
msgid "Compute diff within each group."
msgstr "计算每个组内的差值。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff:3 of
msgid "Number of positions to diff within each group."
msgstr "在每个组内进行差分的位置数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff:5 of
msgid "Column(s) to diff.  If None, all non-group-key columns are diffed."
msgstr "要进行差分的列。如果为None，则对所有非分组键列进行差分。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff:8 of
msgid "Diffed LiteFrame with same shape (row count preserved)."
msgstr "差分后的LiteFrame，形状相同（保留行数）。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff:12 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff:14 of
msgid ""
"Grouped transforms hash-shuffle rows by group key, so the output row "
"order follows reducer/hash-partition order and is **not** aligned with "
"the input frame (unlike pandas, which preserves the index). Row count is "
"preserved. Order restoration via a place-back operator "
"(``LiteFrameIlocSetItem``) is planned; see "
"``docs/designs/liteframe/operators/window.md``."
msgstr ""
"分组转换通过分组键进行哈希洗牌行，因此输出行顺序遵循reducer/hash分区顺序"
"，与输入框架**不**对齐（不像pandas那样保留索引）。保留行数。计划通过place"
"-back操作符（``LiteFrameIlocSetItem``）恢复顺序；参见``docs/designs/"
"liteframe/operators/window.md``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff:21 of
msgid ""
"Null-key rows are preserved with a null result (matching pandas "
"``groupby.shift()`` under the default ``dropna=True``); they are not "
"grouped together."
msgstr ""
"空键行被保留并产生空结果（匹配pandas ``groupby.shift()`` 在默认 ``dropna="
"True`` 下的行为）；它们不会被分组在一起。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff.rst
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.diff:25 of
msgid "If any transformed column is non-numeric."
msgstr "如果任何转换列是非数值型的。"

